{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Substitution.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Substitution.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"substitution substitution","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Substitution.md","fileName":"Substitution.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Substitution","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 23:41\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Algebraic Expressions]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Algebraic Expressions","Expression Evaluation","Equation Verification","algebraessentials.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Substitution.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Substitution.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"substitution substitution","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Substitution.md","fileName":"Substitution.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Substitution","heading":"Substitution","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Substitution replaces a variable with an equivalent value or expression. It is the central step in [[Expression Evaluation]] and [[Equation Verification]]. Every occurrence governed by the assignment must be replaced consistently.\n\nGrouping protects structure during replacement. If (x=-2), substituting into (x^2) gives ((-2)^2=4), not (-2^2=-4). An expression may also be substituted for a variable, allowing a general identity to generate a related one; replacing (b) by (-b) in the square-of-a-sum identity produces the square-of-a-difference identity.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Algebraic Expressions","Expression Evaluation","Equation Verification","algebraessentials.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Substitution.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Substitution.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"substitution substitution","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Substitution.md","fileName":"Substitution.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Substitution","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[algebraessentials.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Algebraic Expressions","Expression Evaluation","Equation Verification","algebraessentials.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}